      },
      "worked": "First apply the quotient rule:\n$$\\begin{align*}f'(x)&=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe product rule gives $(u'v-uv')'=u''v-uv''$. Apply the quotient rule again:\n$$\\begin{align*}f''(x)&=\\frac{(u''v-uv'')v^2-2vv'(u'v-uv')}{v^4}\\\\f''(x)&=\\frac{u''v-uv''-2vv'f'}{v^2}\\\\f''(x)&=\\frac{u''-v''f-2v'f'}{v},\\end{align*}$$\nusing $u=vf$ and $u'v-uv'=v^2f'$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
